OL,3,CIn pictures: When the world plunged
OL,4,Cinto darkness in the 1999 solar eclipse
OL,6,FThe last time the UK saw a solar
OL,7,Feclipse this impressive was on August
OL,8,F11, 1999, the most widely-viewed
OL,9,Feclipse in history. ITV News looks
OL,10,Fback at the key pictures from that day.
OL,12,FCrowds camped out all night in
OL,13,FCornwall to watch the display,
OL,14,Ftravelling from as far as Australia.
OL,16,FThe weather back then was not as clear
OL,17,Fand sunny as it is expected to be on
OL,18,FWednesday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
