OL,3,CIn pictures: When the world plunged
OL,4,Cinto darkness in the 1999 solar eclipse
OL,6,FClouds covered the skies, and people
OL,7,Fhid from showers under raincoats and
OL,8,Fumbrellas.
OL,10,FSuddenly, light turned to dark as the
OL,11,Fthree celestial bodies aligned.
OL,13,F"It's really spooky," one viewer told
OL,14,FITV News at the time, viewing it from
OL,15,FFalmouth beach. "I don't understand
OL,16,Fit. It's very frightening," she added.
OL,18,FThe eclipse lasted two minutes, six
OL,19,Fseconds. Millions viewed the
OL,20,Fphenomenon from all over the world.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
