OL,3,CIn pictures: When the world plunged
OL,4,Cinto darkness in the 1999 solar eclipse
OL,6,FIt was the last solar eclipse of the
OL,7,Fmillennium, sweeping across Europe
OL,8,Ftoward the Bay of Bengal.
OL,10,FSadly, some were unable to catch a
OL,11,Fglimpse. In Spicheren, France, people
OL,12,Fgathered with solar telescopes and
OL,13,Feclipse glasses, but the weather was
OL,14,Ftoo bad to see the total eclipse.
OL,16,FIn western India, scientists and
OL,17,Fsightseers were disappointed as a
OL,18,Fprevious heavy monsoon caused overcast
OL,19,Fconditions and prevented them from
OL,20,Fviewing the last total solar eclipse
OL,21,Fof the millennium.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
