OL,3,CIn pictures: When the world plunged
OL,4,Cinto darkness in the 1999 solar eclipse
OL,6,FMany retailers have sold out of the
OL,7,Fglasses, but there are alternative
OL,8,Fways to watch the phenomenon without
OL,9,Flooking at the Sun, including
OL,10,Flivestreams, DIY pinhole viewers and
OL,11,Feven colanders.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
